  "scope": "Separate kept-stack clone with an opt-in segment timer (GGML_M5_LAB_SEGMENTS). When set, each graph is encoded by one thread into one command buffer per segment: a segment ends after every hyper-connection merge, and each layer's routed expert matrices (first MUL_MAT_ID through ffn_moe_down) get their own. Fusion is decided over the whole graph as before; a new command buffer only adds a full barrier. With the flag unset the encoder is the kept engine's. Kernels, fusion rules, weights, arithmetic, allocator and context policy unchanged; diagnostic only, never a default.",
